\newlabel{tab:admet}{{2}{10}{ADMET endpoints, nominal FDR $q=0.2$, score-based SPDT (\texttt {results/*\_fdr\_metrics.csv}). ``---'' indicates zero compounds selected (true FDR undefined). All three splits use the same trained model per endpoint; only the calibration/test partition differs}{table.caption.11}{}}
